<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in very heavy trading Friday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average rose 35.03 to 6,348.03, a record. For the week, the Dow rose 128.21 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 1.01 to 390.02, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose 11 cents.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1,242 to 1,177.</p>
<p>Volume was 526,623,290, compared with 478,546,750 Thursday. For the week, volume was 2,263,713,290.</p>
